= Markets Must Serve People

SLD delegates retrieve the cleanest line in their declaration: markets are to
serve people, not the other way round. They want every Lewica proposal tested
against wages, security and access before anyone asks whether investors approve.

SLD strength: **[+ barons_strength +]/100**. Workers: **[+ workers_support
+]/100**. KO relation: **[+ ko_relation +]/100**.

- @sld_markets_doctrine
- @sld_markets_test
- @sld_markets_refuse

@sld_markets_doctrine
title: Put the sentence at the top of the programme
subtitle: SLD owns a clear social-democratic doctrine; liberal allies and Market Left recoil.
on-arrival: barons_strength += 4; barons_dissent -= 8; workers_support += 5; pensioner_support += 3; public_sector_support += 3; labor_credibility += 3; left_economic_position -= 3; capitalism_acceptance -= 4; market_liberal_dissent += 6; ko_relation -= 4; p2050_relation -= 3; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "SLD makes markets serving people Lewica's governing test"

Every chapter now begins with the people who must benefit and the public power
needed to make it happen. The programme is easier to understand and harder to
sell as harmless continuity.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_markets_test
title: Use it as a social-impact test
subtitle: Keep the line, but translate it into published tests rather than a doctrine of ownership.
on-arrival: barons_strength += 2; barons_dissent -= 4; workers_support += 3; public_trust += 3; institutional_trust += 2; administrative_capacity += 2; market_liberal_dissent += 2; ko_relation -= 1; news_headline = "Lewica adopts a people-first impact test for economic policy"

Budgets, concessions and regulations must publish their effect on wages,
services and regional inequality. The declaration becomes an administrative
instrument without settling every argument about ownership.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_markets_refuse
title: Keep the phrase in the declaration
subtitle: Free. Avoid an economic-line fight; SLD concludes that its programme is ornamental.
on-arrival: poland_sld_markets_timer = 6; barons_dissent += 8; barons_strength -= 1; workers_support -= 2; labor_credibility -= 2; market_liberal_dissent -= 2; ko_relation += 2; news_headline = "Lewica leaves SLD's people-before-markets formula in the archive"

The sentence survives in speeches for party anniversaries. It changes no
brief, no negotiation and no coalition red line.

- #poland_card_finish


