= Freedom From Economic Coercion

SLD's programme says freedom includes choices made without economic pressure.
The old organisation wants Lewica to stop treating liberty and material
security as separate languages belonging to separate wings.

- @sld_freedom_claim
- @sld_freedom_campaign
- @sld_freedom_refuse

@sld_freedom_claim
title: Make material freedom Lewica's answer to liberalism
subtitle: Link wages, housing and public services to liberty; SLD and labour gain a shared language.
on-arrival: barons_strength += 4; barons_dissent -= 8; labor_strength += 2; labor_dissent -= 4; workers_support += 4; household_security += 3; universal_solidarity += 3; left_economic_position -= 2; ko_relation -= 3; market_liberal_dissent += 4; party_unity += 2; news_headline = "Lewica defines freedom as life without economic coercion"

The party asks what choice means to a tenant facing eviction or a worker who
cannot refuse an unsafe shift. Rights remain individual; the means to exercise
them become collective obligations.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_freedom_campaign
title: Build a campaign around time, security and choice
subtitle: A softer formulation reaches precarious voters without reopening the ownership question.
on-arrival: barons_strength += 2; barons_dissent -= 4; workers_support += 3; young_support += 3; household_security += 2; media_capacity += 2; public_trust += 2; ko_relation += 1; coalition_blur += 1; news_headline = "Lewica campaigns for the time and security to make real choices"

Paid leave, predictable hours and secure tenancies carry the argument. The
philosophy remains present, but the posters carry daily life rather than a
definition of liberal freedom.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_freedom_refuse
title: Leave freedom to the civil-rights chapter
subtitle: Free. Keep the coalition vocabulary tidy; SLD sees the social argument cut in half.
on-arrival: poland_sld_economic_freedom_timer = 7; barons_dissent += 8; labor_dissent += 3; workers_support -= 2; market_liberal_dissent -= 2; ko_relation += 2; coalition_blur += 2; news_headline = "Lewica declines SLD's material definition of freedom"

Social policy promises remain elsewhere in the programme. The word freedom
returns to institutions and private conduct, where coalition partners prefer it.

- #poland_card_finish


