= Put a Turnstile on the Banks

SLD organisers want one revenue promise voters can picture: a tax each time
the financial sector moves money through the system the public guarantees.
Economists warn that the details decide whether trades move abroad.

- @sld_bank_tax_full
- @sld_bank_tax_levy
- @sld_bank_tax_refuse

@sld_bank_tax_full
title: Campaign for a broad transaction tax
subtitle: A sharp distributive line funds the programme; finance and liberal allies mobilise against it.
on-arrival: barons_strength += 4; barons_dissent -= 8; workers_support += 4; pensioner_support += 2; budget_promises += 3; administrative_capacity += 2; left_economic_position -= 3; capitalism_acceptance -= 3; market_liberal_dissent += 7; ko_relation -= 5; p2050_relation -= 4; left_poll -= 0.3; news_headline = "SLD campaigns for a tax on financial transactions"

The levy becomes the receipt attached to every new social promise. Banks call
it an exit notice; SLD calls it rent for using a stable republic.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_bank_tax_levy
title: Narrow it to the largest institutions
subtitle: A bank-sector levy is easier to cost and harder to evade, but loses the original drama.
on-arrival: barons_strength += 2; barons_dissent -= 4; budget_promises += 2; administrative_capacity += 3; public_trust += 2; ko_relation -= 1; market_liberal_dissent += 3; news_headline = "Lewica costs a levy on the largest financial institutions"

The proposal taxes balance sheets rather than every trade. It raises less,
travels better through committees and gives television one fewer verb.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_bank_tax_refuse
title: Finance the programme without a bank tax
subtitle: Free. Protect economic credibility with the centre; SLD loses its clearest payer.
on-arrival: poland_sld_bank_tax_timer = 6; barons_dissent += 9; barons_strength -= 1; market_liberal_dissent -= 3; ko_relation += 3; p2050_relation += 2; administrative_capacity += 1; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "Lewica removes the financial-transaction tax from its programme"

The spending remains. The finance chapter returns to several smaller sources
that are defensible together and invisible one by one.

- #poland_card_finish


