= A Signal in Every Gmina

Years before remote services became normal, SLD promised free broadband or at
least a free access point in every gmina. Its mayors want the party to finish
the map and call access to the network a public utility.

- @sld_broadband_utility
- @sld_broadband_points
- @sld_broadband_refuse

