= No More Polish-Polish War

Wiosna began by refusing the permanent war between the two conservative camps.
Its organisers want a public style built around mutual respect, dialogue and
specific changes that do not require voters to enlist in somebody else's feud.

- @wiosna_dialogue_campaign
- @wiosna_dialogue_forums
- @wiosna_dialogue_refuse

