= Every Lobbyist Leaves a Note

PPS proposes a wonderfully inconvenient rule: parliamentarians publish notes
from every lobbyist meeting, and lobbying firms publish their client lists.
Party whips ask whether informal policy conversations count.

- @pps_lobbying_every_meeting
- @pps_lobbying_register
- @pps_lobbying_refuse

@pps_lobbying_every_meeting
