= No Primacy for Private Property

PPS's programme says public and social enterprises should dominate so that
private ownership no longer enjoys primacy. It proposes state help for firms
converting toward cooperative or employee ownership.

- @pps_property_doctrine
- @pps_property_conversion
- @pps_property_refuse

@pps_property_doctrine
title: Adopt a common-ownership economy as the destination
subtitle: PPS gains an unmistakable doctrine; liberals, barons and coalition partners revolt.
