= The Caring State Has a Receipt

Nowa Lewica's programme calls for a *troskliwe państwo*: a state that notices
need before a citizen has learned which window refuses the form. The phrase can
remain a temperament, or become a list of guarantees with named institutions,
deadlines and public costs.

- @nowa_lewica_care_guarantees
- @nowa_lewica_care_ledger
- @nowa_lewica_care_refuse

@nowa_lewica_care_guarantees
title: Make care a universal organising principle
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. A clear post-merger identity lifts solidarity while liberals demand a price tag.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Writing and touring a universal guarantee needs two resources.
