Low-income households receive more than the headline sum while affluent
families receive less. The treasury saves money; school secretariats inherit
questions about income certificates.

- #poland_card_finish

@nowa_lewica_first_bell_refuse
title: Fold school costs into the existing child benefit
subtitle: Free. Avoid another transfer; campaigners lose the programme's clearest family promise.
