= Parenthood Comes in Equal Shares

Nowa Lewica proposes equal maternity and paternity leave. Equality campaigners
argue that a right transferred back to mothers will reproduce the hiring penalty
the reform is meant to end; employers warn that two genuine absences cost more
than one nominal entitlement.

- @nowa_lewica_leave_equal
- @nowa_lewica_leave_quota
- @nowa_lewica_leave_refuse

@nowa_lewica_leave_equal
title: Promise equal, well-paid and non-transferable leave
subtitle: A clean equality rule changes care and hiring expectations; business allies resist the cost.
on-arrival: feminist_trust += 7; women_support += 6; young_support += 5; household_security += 4; union_trust += 3; party_unity += 3; budget_promises += 3; economic_growth -= 0.1; market_liberal_dissent += 5; ko_relation -= 2; news_headline = "Nowa Lewica promises equal non-transferable leave for both parents"

Each parent receives a paid block that disappears if unused. Employers can no
longer assume which applicant will be away, and fathers cannot donate equality
back to the old division of work.

- #poland_card_finish

@nowa_lewica_leave_quota
title: Reserve a substantial second-parent quota
subtitle: Secure a practical step toward equality without making both entitlements identical.
on-arrival: feminist_trust += 4; women_support += 4; young_support += 4; household_security += 3; public_trust += 2; budget_promises += 1; market_liberal_dissent += 2; p2050_relation += 1; coalition_blur += 1; news_headline = "Nowa Lewica backs a protected paid-leave quota for second parents"

The protected months are long enough to change household habits and hiring
assumptions. The remainder stays flexible, preserving a compromise that the
programme's authors call a beginning.

- #poland_card_finish

@nowa_lewica_leave_refuse
title: Defend parental choice inside the existing system
subtitle: Free. Preserve flexibility; equality groups hear a familiar reason for unequal outcomes.
on-arrival: poland_nowa_lewica_equal_leave_timer = 7; feminist_trust -= 5; women_support -= 3; young_support -= 2; household_security -= 1; market_liberal_dissent -= 3; p2050_relation += 2; coalition_blur += 2; news_headline = "Nowa Lewica declines to equalise paid leave between parents"

Parents may divide the entitlement as they prefer. Wage gaps and workplace
expectations continue doing much of the choosing before the form is signed.

- #poland_card_finish


