= No Child at War With Their Body

The programme pairs nutrition education with body-positive teaching and an
early-warning system for eating disorders. Teachers welcome the recognition
and ask who will train them to distinguish ordinary adolescent distress from a
clinical danger.

- @nowa_lewica_body_positive_standard
- @nowa_lewica_body_positive_pilot
- @nowa_lewica_body_positive_refuse

@nowa_lewica_body_positive_standard
title: Write a national standard with clinicians and pupils
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. A distinctive youth policy gains credibility through expert and student ownership.
