= Two Histories, One Membership

The statute acknowledges both SLD and Wiosna traditions. New members ask
whether that inheritance is a library or a constitution: can every office be
contested by the whole membership, or must the founders keep parallel keys to
the party they have just created?

- @nowa_lewica_two_traditions_members
- @nowa_lewica_two_traditions_charter
- @nowa_lewica_two_traditions_refuse

@nowa_lewica_two_traditions_members
title: Give every member one vote across the whole party
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Integration and organising rise; inherited machines lose protected locks.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: A common register and internal ballot need two resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; party_unity += 7; organiser_energy += 6; local_network += 4; movement_autonomy += 4; public_trust += 3; barons_dissent += 7; progressives_dissent += 3; coalition_blur -= 3; news_headline = "Nowa Lewica gives every member an equal vote across the merged party"

A common register elects local and national authorities. The two histories
remain visible in archives and debates, not in separate electoral colleges.

- #poland_card_finish

@nowa_lewica_two_traditions_charter
title: Protect both traditions under a sunset clause
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Founders receive security while a dated review keeps integration credible.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Negotiating and administering the transitional charter needs one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; party_unity += 5; organiser_energy += 3; barons_dissent -= 4; progressives_dissent -= 3; institutional_trust += 2; coalition_blur += 1; news_headline = "Nowa Lewica protects both founding traditions under a sunset charter"

Parallel representation survives for one full term, after which the membership
must renew it openly or let it lapse. Compromise receives an expiry date.

- #poland_card_finish

@nowa_lewica_two_traditions_refuse
title: Let the informal balance settle itself
subtitle: Free. Avoid reopening the merger deal; every appointment becomes a proxy battle over it.
on-arrival: poland_nowa_lewica_two_traditions_timer = 8; party_unity -= 5; organiser_energy -= 3; barons_dissent += 4; progressives_dissent += 4; labor_dissent += 2; public_trust -= 1; coalition_blur += 4; news_headline = "Nowa Lewica leaves its two founding organisations to divide power informally"

No rule says which inheritance owns which office. That flexibility lasts until
the first nomination, when every old promise is remembered differently.

- #poland_card_finish
